lalo ka lang nakakaakit.

589
00:40:28.134 --> 00:40:30.345
Iniisip ko kung anong klaseng espasyo iyon.

590
00:40:30.428 --> 00:40:31.471
Ang uri ng espasyo

591
00:40:31.554 --> 00:40:34.015
na parang sinadya

592
00:40:35.183 --> 00:40:36.476
