593
00:40:38.144 --> 00:40:39.103
Ginagawa ako nito

594
00:40:40.855 --> 00:40:42.607
gustong punan

595
00:40:43.775 --> 00:40:44.817
espasyong iyon.

596
00:41:17.308 --> 00:41:19.560
KORTE SA SESYON

597
00:41:19.894 --> 00:41:21.813
{\an8}UNANG PAGDINIG NG KRIMINAL NA PAGSUBOK
PARA SA PAGPAPATAY

598
00:41:22.438 --> 00:41:25.149
Counsel, pwede mo bang ulitin iyan, please?

599
00:41:25.775 --> 00:41:27.902
Hindi nagkasala ang nasasakdal.

600
00:41:27.986 --> 00:41:29.654
Ano sa lupa?

601
00:41:29.737 --> 00:41:31.656
Paanong wala siyang kasalanan?

602
00:41:31.739 --> 00:41:34.033
Ang aking anak na babae ay pinatay!

603
00:41:34.117 --> 00:41:36.953
Yung mga nasa gallery, manatiling tahimik.

604
00:41:37.036 --> 00:41:39.247
Umupo ka.

605
00:41:39.330 --> 00:41:40.206
Payo,

606
00:41:40.289 --> 00:41:42.500
